  <h2 id="amcheck">Verifying a training institute before paying</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Check</th>
          <th>How</th>
          <th>Red flag</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Regulator approval</strong></td>
          <td data-label="How">Look up the institute on the official regulator list</td>
          <td data-label="Red flag">Not listed or listed under a different name</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Hangar and aircraft access</strong></td>
          <td data-label="How">Ask to see training aircraft and tools</td>
          <td data-label="Red flag">Only classroom models</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Faculty licences</strong></td>
          <td data-label="How">Ask for faculty licence details</td>
          <td data-label="Red flag">Vague answers</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Fee structure</strong></td>
          <td data-label="How">Get every charge in writing</td>
          <td data-label="Red flag">Extra fees after admission</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Placement claims</strong></td>
          <td data-label="How">Ask for graduate names you can contact</td>
          <td data-label="Red flag">Guaranteed jobs</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Take a parent or friend with you on visits and never pay in cash without a receipt.
  </p>
  <p>
    Compare at least three approved institutes before deciding.
  </p>

