  <h2 id="amdoc">Why documentation is half the job</h2>

  <p>
    Every task in aircraft maintenance is recorded so the next person knows exactly what was done. A missing or wrong entry can ground an aircraft or hide a risk.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
